  "source_preparation": [
    "Validate each downloaded archive SHA-256 against this evidence before extraction. Reject absolute/traversal/link archive members and strip the official one-directory prefix.",
    "Install and activate fixed emsdk 4.0.21 inside sources/emsdk with its embedded .emscripten and a stage-local EM_CACHE.",
    "Extract original splat-transform into sources/splat-transform-v2. Copy the paired rebuilt outputs/webp.mjs and webp.wasm into its lib/.",
    "Apply rollup-pin-source-revision.patch and v2/webp-codec-cleanup.patch exactly; validate original/modified source hashes in the source-patch record.",
    "Run npm ci --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund with the pinned source package-lock.json in the v2 source directory. The recorded run reused an exact filesystem clone of this same v1 install.",
    "Run build-distributions-v2.mjs. It writes and closes all five Rollup bundles and copies the declaration before exit0.",
    "Run the recorded codec, cleanup, bound-distribution, selected upstream tests and CLI-help checks. Compare output hashes, then gzip only the ten overlay paths with level9 and mtime0."
  ],
